{
  "format": "reqin-catalog/1",
  "about": "What can be taken from this product's design, as parts. A part is a piece of the interface someone can say yes or no to: its picture is drawn from a specimen (specimens/) with the stylesheet rules the prototype and the design kit really use for it, so the picture follows the colours, fonts and corners the person has chosen. Screens are added from design/navigation.json and docs/SCREEN_DATA_MAP.md when the catalog is loaded.",
  "stage": "The pictures are drawn on a page of the result's background colour. A specimen is a drawing of the part for this kit: it is not the prototype's markup, which is generated from templates and carries inline styles.",
